text.section:
Any person who commits any of the following acts is guilty of a Class 1 misdemeanor:

Failing to obtain a certificate of registration required by this chapter;


Failing to file a return required by this chapter;


Failing to pay a tax when due under this chapter;


Making a false statement in an application, return, ticket, invoice, statement, or any other document required under this chapter;


Failing to keep records as required under this chapter; or


Refusing to allow the Commissioner or a representative of the Commissioner to examine the person's books and records concerning transactions taxable under this chapter.
